'Subject: meeting thoughts\r\ni \' m sitting here a bit disappointed and pissed .\r\ndo you and pat honestly believe it is \" one man \' s word against another \" on\r\nsetting up the link builder by the 12 th of the month ?\r\nif so , why have i been saying something is wrong with some of the links for\r\nthe last several days ? and why did i work so late the first couple of days of\r\neach month setting up the links when i had so much time ?\r\ni \' m not going to play this game with mr . lloyd . when he took the time to show\r\nup he was coached well in what was needed to be done , how to do it , and when\r\nto do it .\r\nthis situation was entirely predictable . it is always \" i \' m about to do it \"\r\nand it is always an \" i thought you said . . . . . . . . . . . . . \" situation .\r\nyou know better . i won \' t be hung out again .\r\n- attl . htm',ham
