nergy us , lp 5923 775 mmbtu / d 100 \% if / hsc less $ 0 . 24\r\nengage energy us , lp 5848 240 mmbtu / d 100 \% if / hsc less $ 0 . 24\r\nswift energy 2630 21 mmbtu / d 90 \% if / hsc less $ 0 . 258\r\nadditionally , this are producer svcs . deals and should be tracked in the im\r\nwellhead portfolio . . . attached to the gathering contract .\r\nthanks ,\r\nvlt\r\nx 3 - 6353',ham
