'Subject: gulf plains\r\nimbalance update : i spoke with mike bilberry and confirmed that this deal\r\nreally is energy in / energy out . we should not be impacted in any way by a\r\nreallocation to correct pvr percentages or a c 5 correction at the plant .\r\nhpl / ena should rereceive the same volume , dth for dth at the residue or at a\r\nredelivery point such as lobo / agua . i have left a message for my counterpart\r\nat duke and am requesting that they deliver to us , somewhere , an additional\r\n20 , 125 dth / day for the month of december to balance us out .\r\nplease let me know if you have any questions or comments . i will advise\r\neveryone upon their agreement to payback so that our respective positions\r\nreflect the additional supply .\r\nmary',ham
