'Subject: february 2000 production , pg & e discrepancy for 02 / 24 / 00 ( pan\r\nenergy exchange deal )\r\nstacey -\r\nas per my earlier voice mail messages , i needed to confirm what the actual\r\nflow of gas was on pg & e for february 24 th . the service summary report from\r\npg & e indicated a flow of 50 , 000 mmbtus on the 24 th , however , the swamp rat\r\nfuel allocations ( hpl ) indicates a flow of 53 , 000 mmbtus . can you ask pg & e\r\nto confirm which of these volume is correct so that the february allocations\r\ncan be finalized ? please let me know if there is any additional information\r\ni need to provide you .\r\nthanks for your help -\r\nkatherine',ham
